    "nextSteps": [
      "Formalize Firoozbakht ⟹ Cramér-type gap bound p_{n+1}-p_n < (log p_n)^2 - log p_n for large n.",
      "Build a Decidable instance for the integer-power form restricted to n ≤ N, certifying the conjecture on the known numerical range from a prime table."
    ]
